[{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0088","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-0313","title":"Adobe Flash Player 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在 Use-After-Free 释放后使用漏洞（CVE-416），源于 ByteArray 与 Workers 组件交互时内存管理不当，攻击者可构造恶意 Flash 内容触发悬空指针引用，导致任意代码执行。影响范围覆盖 Windows/OS X 平台 13.0.0.269 之前版本、14.x 至 16.x 16.0.0.305 之前版本，以及 Linux 平台 11.2.202.442 之前版本。攻击向量为网络远程攻击（CVSS 3.1 AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N），无需认证与用户交互，CVSS 评分 9.8（CRITICAL）。该漏洞于 2015 年 2 月已在野利用（CISA KEV 目录收录），攻击者可通过诱导受害者访问嵌入恶意 Flash 的网页实现远程代码执行（RCE），Metasploit 已集成利用模块（ExploitDB-36579）。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复，建议升级至 Flash Player 16.0.0.305 或更高版本（Linux 升级至 11.2.202.442），并建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 以规避后续风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-0313"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-02-02T19:59:00.053","updated":"2026-06-17T00:19:58.420","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 到 16.0.0.305 或更高版本（如果使用 Windows/OS X），或升级到 11.2.202.442 或更高版本（如果使用 Linux），这些版本修复了该未授权访问漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙中禁用 Flash 插件以临时缓解风险，并优先迁移到使用 HTML5 技术的现代 Web 浏览器和 Web 应用，以完全消除 Flash 攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-02/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-02/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-02/msg00008.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-02/msg00009.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/131189/Adobe-Flash-Player-ByteArray-With-Workers-Use-After-Free.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/62528","http://secunia.com/advisories/62777","http://secunia.com/advisories/62895","http://www.osvdb.org/117853","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72429","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031686","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/100641","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsa15-02.html","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb15-04.html","https://technet.microsoft.com/library/security/2755801","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36579/","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-0313","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36579","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-0313.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/54c42a6a9df264c8b3d9aea3e258cd29ef8a2a93/2015/CVE-2015-0313.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-0313","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-0313/README_KO.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2015-0313.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/SSVC/data/2015/CVE-2015-0313.json","https://github.com/7erryX/7erryX.github.io/blob/7e22805960f37f85ee81ceb7e608b64a0f01f961/source/_posts/Vulnerability%20Investigation/CVE-2015-0313-Investigation.md","https://github.com/eyalmazuz/ThreatIntelligenceCorpus/blob/c47f9d2b7ba92e0cbba71c67b938a49e055c5cdc/Corpus/110786.txt","https://github.com/riusksk/vul_war/blob/c9c5b9b0e0649997259323423a634b80763aef0f/abstract_contents_english.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/798a31226c5b1d5c9cc61c5fe52f04996d380b21/data_single/2015/CVE-2015-0313.csv","https://github.com/SecurityObscurity/cve-2015-0313"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0008","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-1419","title":"vsftpd vsftpd 访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"vsftpd 3.0.2 及更早版本中存在未明安全漏洞，与 deny_file 配置项的解析逻辑缺陷有关。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过网络发送特制请求，绕过 deny_file 设置的文件访问限制规则，获取本应被禁止访问的文件。该漏洞影响所有使用 vsftpd 3.0.2 及之前版本的系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。各 Linux 发行版已发布补丁修复此问题，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2015-1419"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2015-01-28T11:59:08.417","updated":"2026-06-17T00:22:23.320","remediation":"升级 vsftpd 至 3.0.3 及以上版本。Debian/Ubuntu 用户执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install vsftpd`，Red Hat/CentOS 用户参考对应发行版补丁。如无法升级，在 vsftpd.conf 中确保 `deny_file` 规则同时覆盖 `/./` 路径变体，例如 `deny_file=/*` 改为 `deny_file={/*,/./*}`，并重启 vsftpd 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-01/msg00023.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2015-01/msg00041.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/62415","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1419.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2015/CVE-2015-1419.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4e43b7480659ad7b31b061308a3e6980a1790289/network/cves/2015/CVE-2015-1419.yaml","https://github.com/void-linux/void-packages/blob/cb43d8782b12d79413a7e04f0d24396080067c60/srcpkgs/vsftpd/patches/007-CVE-2015-1419.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27eee309d10a00ce5571c5ab1765599e23f1725f/cves/2015/1xxx/CVE-2015-1419.json","https://github.com/yodaos-project/yodaos/blob/d0d7bbc277c0fc1c64e2e0a1c82fe6e63f6eb954/openwrt/feeds/packages/net/vsftpd/patches/007-CVE-2015-1419.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/3d42c0a0ac9d57c015f2a273be745fae94b628c5/pkgs/by-name/vs/vsftpd/package.nix","https://github.com/ericpaulbishop/gargoyle/blob/06b2b911e35c9d675a7f158b4072fc54df68bcfa/package/vsftpd/patches/007-CVE-2015-1419.patch","https://github.com/Freetz/freetz/blob/75984884e4353db3b45b04cd37707c6e929ca0ec/make/vsftpd/patches/0050-CVE-2015-1419.debian.patch","https://github.com/maxnet/berryboot/blob/68ffb45a3e4545b9c1d599238d0f99c8602102a2/buildroot-2018.08/package/vsftpd/0003-fix-CVE-2015-1419.patch","https://github.com/procount/pinn/blob/89e4c250ced8bf5126427f716db5101c4da14b3f/buildroot-2023.02/package/vsftpd/0002-fix-CVE-2015-1419.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0077","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-0311","title":"Adobe Flash Player 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在 Use-After-Free 漏洞（CVE-2015-0311），具体存在于 ByteArray 类的 UncompressViaZlibVariant 方法中。攻击者可通过构造恶意 Flash 内容，诱导用户访问嵌入恶意 SWF 文件的网页，触发内存释放后重用漏洞，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows/OS X 上 13.0.0.262 及 14.x、15.x、16.x 至 16.0.0.287 版本，以及 Linux 上 11.2.202.438 及之前版本。CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限、无需用户交互。2015 年 1 月已在野利用，CISA 已列入已知被利用漏洞目录。Adobe 已发布安全更新修复，建议升级至 Flash Player 16.0.0.305 或更高版本。Metasploit 框架已集成利用模块（ExploitDB-36360），多个公开 PoC 可在 GitHub 获取。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-0311"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-01-23T21:59:04.897","updated":"2026-06-17T00:19:58.077","remediation":"立即卸载 Adobe Flash Player 并升级至现代浏览器原生 HTML5 支持。若必须保留旧版 Flash，请升级至 16.0.0.305 及以上版本（Windows/OS X）或 11.2.202.554 及以上版本（Linux），下载地址：https://get.adobe.com/cn/flashplayer/。临时缓解：浏览器禁用 Flash 插件或设置为“点击播放”，企业可通过组策略禁用 Flash ActiveX/插件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsa15-01.html","http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb15-03.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-01/msg00027.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-01/msg00031.html","http://malware.dontneedcoffee.com/2015/01/unpatched-vulnerability-0day-in-flash.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/62432","http://secunia.com/advisories/62543","http://secunia.com/advisories/62650","http://secunia.com/advisories/62660","http://secunia.com/advisories/62740","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201502-02.xml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72283","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031597","https://technet.microsoft.com/library/security/2755801","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-0311","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/36360","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-0311.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/54c42a6a9df264c8b3d9aea3e258cd29ef8a2a93/2015/CVE-2015-0311.json","https://github.com/CCrashBandicot/helpful/blob/336b2c95b482d6c9de7756109b2699c7cfd8545c/CVE-2015-0311.rb","https://github.com/SuperKieran/WooyunDrops/blob/df3319b3cd839f447ba2d1ab191b6a4b57991d0a/static/drops/524.Exploiting%20CVE-2015-0311,%20Part%20II:%20Bypassing%20Control%20Flow%20Guard%20on%20Windows%208.1.html","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/62d3575ad7f5edb0085d16f3737a19e0c0ea724b/2015/CVE-2015-0311/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-0311","https://github.com/rmusser01/Infosec_Reference/blob/af8b68e2194e695c542eb76fba762d2f0a19a0dc/Draft/Exploit_Dev.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/ab3fc962367cab15f8d25f548015e9e8509f4eca/references/CVE-2015-0311-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2015/CVE-2015-0311/README_KO.md","https://github.com/jr64/CVE-2015-0311"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2015/POC-AVE-2015-0077.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2015/EXP-AVE-2015-0077.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2015/AVE-2015-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2015-0066","file_name":"2015/AVE-2015-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2015-0310","title":"Adobe Flash Player 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 存在内存地址信息泄露漏洞，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 Flash 内容（如嵌入在网页或 Office 文档中的 SWF 文件）触发该漏洞，从而绕过 Windows 系统的 ASLR 地址随机化保护机制，实现内存地址泄漏或远程代码执行。受影响版本包括 Windows 和 macOS 平台上的 13.0.0.262 及更早版本、14.x 至 16.0.0.287 之前版本，以及 Linux 平台上的 11.2.202.438 及更早版本。攻击者需诱导用户使用受影响的 Flash Player 打开恶意网页或文档，利用该漏洞可实现任意代码执行并完全控制用户系统。该漏洞于 2015 年 1 月被发现在野外活跃利用，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Adobe 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 16.0.0.287 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2015-0310"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2015-01-23T21:59:00.050","updated":"2026-06-17T00:19:57.890","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至安全版本：Windows 和 OS X 用户升级到 13.0.0.262 / 16.0.0.287，Linux 用户升级到 11.2.202.438；如无法立即升级，请在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件作为临时缓解措施。由于 Flash Player 已于 2020 年底终止支持，建议彻底卸载该组件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb15-02.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/62452","http://secunia.com/advisories/62601","http://secunia.com/advisories/62660","http://secunia.com/advisories/62740","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201502-02.xml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/72261","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1031609","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2015-0310","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2015/CVE-2015-0310.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c56d78ae41d8368dc9c61cbfd15221820d154186/2015/0xxx/CVE-2015-0310.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2015/CVE-2015-0310","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2015-0310-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/thdusdl1219/CVE-Study/blob/6bc0a2f8bf5dd